'''Klossen''' is the upgraded form of [[Flametal Mace]] using the [[Jade]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use Jade, they gain 10 [[Poison|poison damage]] and their hit effect has a 20% chance to apply [[Immobilized]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* The slower secondary attack deals 2.5x damage and 2x staggering.

An upgraded Flametal Mace will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Klossen.

